<TEI xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0" xml:id="CH2a1492-en-e522cb7a" type="transl"><teiHeader><fileDesc><titleStmt><title>Translation of  into (English)</title><editor role="translator">AI - Gemini</editor></titleStmt><publicationStmt><ab>published electronically as part of the TLS project at https://hxwd.org</ab><availability status="2"><ab>This work has been licensed for use in the TLS</ab></availability></publicationStmt><sourceDesc><bibl><title/>2026</bibl><ab>Translation of <bibl corresp="#CH2a1492"><title xml:lang="och"/></bibl> into <lang xml:lang="en">English</lang>.</ab></sourceDesc></fileDesc><profileDesc><creation resp="#CH">Initially created: <date>2026-03-10T19:27:51.376+09:00</date> by CH</creation></profileDesc></teiHeader><text><body><div><head>Translated parts</head><p xml:id="CH2a1492-start"><seg corresp="#CH2a1492_CHANT_003-31a.38" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-10T19:28:52.21+09:00">The Grand General, Wáng Dūn, then rewarded the civil and military officials of Jīngzhōu.</seg><seg corresp="#CH2a1492_CHANT_003-31a.39" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-10T19:28:52.21+09:00">(Guó Píngzǐ's) accumulated food and drink was (so much it would feed) twenty men,</seg><seg corresp="#CH2a1492_CHANT_003-31a.40" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-10T19:28:52.21+09:00">yet he could not be moved.</seg><seg corresp="#CH2a1492_CHANT_003-31a.41" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-10T19:28:52.21+09:00">So (Wáng Dūn) borrowed Guó Píngzǐ's jade pillow,</seg><seg corresp="#CH2a1492_CHANT_003-31a.42" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-10T19:28:52.21+09:00">and immediately carried it down from the bed.</seg><seg corresp="#CH2a1492_CHANT_003-31a.43" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-10T19:28:52.21+09:00">Guó Píngzǐ, pulling with his hand, snapped the Grand General's belt.</seg><seg corresp="#CH2a1492_CHANT_003-31a.44" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-10T19:28:52.21+09:00">He fought very fiercely with the strong warriors.</seg><seg corresp="#CH2a1492_CHANT_003-31a.45" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-10T19:28:52.21+09:00">Then he managed to go up onto the roof.</seg><seg corresp="#CH2a1492_CHANT_003-31a.46" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-10T19:28:52.21+09:00">After a long while, he died."</seg><seg corresp="#CH2a1492_CHANT_003-32a.1" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-10T19:28:52.21+09:00"/><seg corresp="#CH2a1492_CHANT_003-32a.2" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-10T19:28:52.21+09:00">After Wáng Dūn came downstream,</seg><seg corresp="#CH2a1492_CHANT_003-32a.3" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-10T19:28:52.21+09:00">he moored his boats at Shítou.</seg><seg corresp="#CH2a1492_CHANT_003-32a.4" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-10T19:28:52.21+09:00">He had the intention of deposing Emperor Míng.</seg><seg corresp="#CH2a1492_CHANT_003-32a.5" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-10T19:28:52.21+09:00">His hall was filled with guests.</seg><seg corresp="#CH2a1492_CHANT_003-32a.6" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-10T19:28:52.21+09:00">Wáng Dūn knew the Emperor was intelligent,</seg><seg corresp="#CH2a1492_CHANT_003-32a.7" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-10T19:28:52.21+09:00">so he wanted to depose him on the grounds of unfilial conduct.</seg><seg corresp="#CH2a1492_CHANT_003-32a.8" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-10T19:28:52.21+09:00">Whenever he spoke of the Emperor's unfilial conduct,</seg><seg corresp="#CH2a1492_CHANT_003-32a.9" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-10T19:28:52.21+09:00">he always claimed it was what Wēn Tàizhēn had said.</seg><seg corresp="#CH2a1492_CHANT_003-32a.10" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-10T19:28:52.21+09:00">Wēn (Tàizhēn) had once been the Supervisor of the Eastern Palace,</seg><seg corresp="#CH2a1492_CHANT_003-32a.11" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-10T19:28:52.21+09:00">and later he was my Chief of Staff.</seg><seg corresp="#CH2a1492_CHANT_003-32a.12" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-10T19:28:52.21+09:00">He knew him very well.</seg><seg corresp="#CH2a1492_CHANT_003-32a.13" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-10T19:28:52.21+09:00">Shortly thereafter,</seg><seg corresp="#CH2a1492_CHANT_003-32a.14" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-10T19:28:52.21+09:00">Wēn (Tàizhēn) arrived.</seg><seg corresp="#CH2a1492_CHANT_003-32a.15" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-10T19:28:52.21+09:00">Wáng Dūn then displayed his imposing manner,</seg><seg corresp="#CH2a1492_CHANT_003-32a.16" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-10T19:28:52.21+09:00">and asked Wēn (Tàizhēn), saying:</seg><seg corresp="#CH2a1492_CHANT_003-32a.17" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-10T19:28:52.21+09:00">"What kind of person was the Crown Prince?"</seg><seg corresp="#CH2a1492_CHANT_003-32a.18" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-10T19:28:52.21+09:00">Wēn (Tàizhēn) replied:</seg><seg corresp="#CH2a1492_CHANT_003-32a.19" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-10T19:28:52.21+09:00">"A common person like myself cannot fathom a noble person."</seg><seg corresp="#CH2a1492_CHANT_003-32a.20" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-10T19:28:52.21+09:00">Wáng Dūn, with a harsh voice and stern expression,</seg><seg corresp="#CH2a1492_CHANT_003-32a.21" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-10T19:28:52.21+09:00">wanting to use his power to make (Wēn) obey him,</seg><seg corresp="#CH2a1492_CHANT_003-32a.22" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-10T19:28:52.21+09:00">then asked Wēn (Tàizhēn) again:</seg><seg corresp="#CH2a1492_CHANT_003-32a.23" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-10T19:28:52.21+09:00">"Why is the Crown Prince considered good?"</seg><seg corresp="#CH2a1492_CHANT_003-32a.24" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-10T19:28:52.21+09:00">Wēn (Tàizhēn) replied:</seg><seg corresp="#CH2a1492_CHANT_003-32a.25" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-10T19:28:52.21+09:00">"He grasps the profound and reaches the distant,</seg></p></div></body></text></TEI>